e><div class=3D"product-entry__content prose prose-lg article-content"><p>M=
ammoth reads a DOT file describing a pipeline graph and executes it node by=
 node, dispatching each stage to an LLM coding agent. You define the workfl=
ow as a directed graph =E2=80=94 nodes are tasks, edges are transitions, at=
tributes configure behavior =E2=80=94 and mammoth handles the execution, re=
tries, checkpointing, and human approval gates.</p><h2 id=3D"install">Insta=
ll</h2><div class=3D"highlight"><pre tabindex=3D"0" style=3D"color: rgb(248=
