 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1"></path></svg></button></pre=
><h2 id=3D"requirements">Requirements</h2><ul><li>Go 1.25+ (for building fr=
om source)</li><li>At least one LLM API key: <code>ANTHROPIC_API_KEY</code>=
, <code>OPENAI_API_KEY</code>, or <code>GEMINI_API_KEY</code></li><li>Graph=
